#### `@ObjectIdColumn`

Marks a property in your entity as `ObjectId`.
This decorator is only used in MongoDB.
Every entity in MongoDB must have an `ObjectId` column.
Example:

```typescript
@Entity()
export class User {
    @ObjectIdColumn()
    id: ObjectId
}
```

Learn more about [MongoDB](../drivers/mongodb.md).

